(7528886, 1204040, 28742, '<td valign="top">On challenges like this, I have to ask myself if this is something I would hang in my bedroom or living room. 100% YES on this one. :) To some, the message in this image will be something like "a warning to humanity" or a statement on the human condition. When I listen, this speaks something different to me. It says "Hey, you are not alone in your lunacy." In fact it might even be telling me that I might actually be relatively normal. :P Gotta give it a 10 for it''s uplifting messages.</td>', 'On challenges like this, I have to ask myself if this is something I would hang in my bedroom or living room. 100% YES on this one. :) To some, the message in this image will be something like "a warning to humanity" or a statement on the human condition. When I listen, this speaks something different to me. It says "Hey, you are not alone in your lunacy." In fact it might even be telling me that I might actually be relatively normal. :P Gotta give it a 10 for it''s uplifting messages.', '2017-08-15 01:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
