(7529874, 1204020, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine mysterious, evocative image.  The tonal shadings and transitions are interesting to explore.  I especially appreciate the erosion on the right, like ice receding at pond''s edge.  The eyes have been handled very subtly. A co-favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Fine mysterious, evocative image.  The tonal shadings and transitions are interesting to explore.  I especially appreciate the erosion on the right, like ice receding at pond''s edge.  The eyes have been handled very subtly. A co-favorite in the challenge.', '2017-08-20 13:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529875, 1204036, 173844, '<td valign="top">Looks like an artist''s sketchbook or a palimpsest, or even ancient cave art.  Invites the viewer in to resolve an unspoken mystery.  The background, like pencil shading, is effectively utilized.  Entirely enjoyable.  A co-favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like an artist''s sketchbook or a palimpsest, or even ancient cave art.  Invites the viewer in to resolve an unspoken mystery.  The background, like pencil shading, is effectively utilized.  Entirely enjoyable.  A co-favorite in the challenge.', '2017-08-20 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529877, 1204035, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful recession of planes and vistas, transfixing for the viewer as perhaps for the shadowed figure to the left as well.  The excellent title takes the stop sign as a second terminus.  The tension is palpable, yet the world does go on beyond the sign, offering more.  Fine image.</td>', 'Wonderful recession of planes and vistas, transfixing for the viewer as perhaps for the shadowed figure to the left as well.  The excellent title takes the stop sign as a second terminus.  The tension is palpable, yet the world does go on beyond the sign, offering more.  Fine image.', '2017-08-20 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529879, 1204044, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like an architect''s dream arising from his draft, putting on solidity in a synthesis of grays in a living grid.  An enjoyable feeling of inception and birth.  Beautifully integrated. And it looks good, too.</td>', 'Like an architect''s dream arising from his draft, putting on solidity in a synthesis of grays in a living grid.  An enjoyable feeling of inception and birth.  Beautifully integrated. And it looks good, too.', '2017-08-20 13:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529887, 1203839, 173844, '<td valign="top">Compelling colors in this patch of graffiti.  I like it, and it feels like a Klee or Miro.  Perhaps this was created by the photographer, and then, great; on the other hand, if it''s an image of someone else''s art, it''s less true to the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Compelling colors in this patch of graffiti.  I like it, and it feels like a Klee or Miro.  Perhaps this was created by the photographer, and then, great; on the other hand, if it''s an image of someone else''s art, it''s less true to the spirit of the challenge.', '2017-08-20 14:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529888, 1204009, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tangle of shadows, outdoor furniture and reflections.  Works well in black and white.</td>', 'Wonderful tangle of shadows, outdoor furniture and reflections.  Works well in black and white.', '2017-08-20 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529890, 1204017, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the somewhat somber colors and the joie de vivre of the figures.  The background tilt adds to the jauntiness and the third, smaller figure before her own urban background adds additional interest and dimension.  This is done by a steady, confident and highly competent hand, masterfully put together.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the somewhat somber colors and the joie de vivre of the figures.  The background tilt adds to the jauntiness and the third, smaller figure before her own urban background adds additional interest and dimension.  This is done by a steady, confident and highly competent hand, masterfully put together.', '2017-08-20 14:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529893, 1203785, 109363, '<td valign="top">haha punny!</td>', 'haha punny!', '2017-08-20 15:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
