(7529948, 1204017, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is real art. It has dramatic nuance and visual punch. The equivocal postures of the figures- somewhere between desperation and elation - and shapes - alternating between cutout and solid - perform their drama against the theatrical, noirish shadows. I love the vicious competition between the natural human shapes and hard unnatural straight lines and angles. Quite a masterful result.</td>', 'This is real art. It has dramatic nuance and visual punch. The equivocal postures of the figures- somewhere between desperation and elation - and shapes - alternating between cutout and solid - perform their drama against the theatrical, noirish shadows. I love the vicious competition between the natural human shapes and hard unnatural straight lines and angles. Quite a masterful result.', '2017-08-20 22:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529949, 1204039, 94815, '<td valign="top">Neat take on 20th century modern art iconography. Don''t know how else to describe this except to add that it has impact for me as something close to Op Art but also synthesizing ideas of Malevich''s Supremetism and even Yves Klein for me. The bottom line is that it is a sensitively encapsulated punch of visual sensation. Can I say the red is perfect on my retina display.</td>', 'Neat take on 20th century modern art iconography. Don''t know how else to describe this except to add that it has impact for me as something close to Op Art but also synthesizing ideas of Malevich''s Supremetism and even Yves Klein for me. The bottom line is that it is a sensitively encapsulated punch of visual sensation. Can I say the red is perfect on my retina display.', '2017-08-20 22:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529951, 1204035, 94815, '<td valign="top">What a powerful juxtaposition of the profile and the sign. Perfectly composed. Brilliant example of "pure" photographic art  (unless I''m a fool).</td>', 'What a powerful juxtaposition of the profile and the sign. Perfectly composed. Brilliant example of "pure" photographic art  (unless I''m a fool).', '2017-08-20 22:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529952, 1203874, 94815, '<td valign="top">Love this example of what I''ve attempted so many times but you have shown how to do. Perfectly found and composed aggregation of the essential elements: manhole cover, calligraphic tar patches and pedestrian''s legs. Something for contemplation.</td>', 'Love this example of what I''ve attempted so many times but you have shown how to do. Perfectly found and composed aggregation of the essential elements: manhole cover, calligraphic tar patches and pedestrian''s legs. Something for contemplation.', '2017-08-20 23:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
